  "label": "Emotional Release",
  "description": "The act of letting go of pent-up emotions or stress through a physical or psychological outlet. In the context of the meme, the man's drinking and the text imply that he is experiencing a form of emotional release from the stress of no longer having to interact with his ex future mother-in-law. This concept is central to understanding the humor and the underlying emotional message of the meme.",
